	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nxSBN88yO8TfKnIAg",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 17, DX 14, IQ 12, HT 12, HP 21, WILL 14, PER 13, FP 14, SPEED 6.5, MOVE 6, DODGE 9, DR 2. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "n1aGw_RO5_aocy4Se",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 49 (offense 25, protection 24), threat tier standard, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "nVB_JXctLNI4vGD2Z",
			"text": "Dominating Gaze: No attack roll and no active defense. Dominating Gaze (16): 1d-4 toxic, Reach Ranged, gaze. Meet its eyes and resist with Will, or obey and remember it afterwards as a decision freely made. It prefers this to violence; violence is noisy."
		},
		{
			"id": "nvQTOhbXhxWp6ipjm",
			"text": "Racial cost: 374 points of traits plus 20 points of skills."
		},
