			"id": "ns3ZDxAiuYL6uqUE1",
			"text": "Body weight: 150 lb."
		},
		{
			"id": "nO4BzKF1F9rfbEPPZ",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6 (primary)."
		},
		{
			"id": "nWL3o2RhCafQByoWu",
			"text": "Sunlight does 1d per minute of exposure. Folklore's other bans — thresholds, running water, the stake — vary by telling and are the GM's to rule."
		},
		{
			"id": "nUHLwl031M_ey_Ayo",
			"text": "Wounds close on their own, which does not make it unkillable. Fire, beheading and daylight are the traditional ends and nothing here rules them out."
		},
